    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n41137" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐπισυν-δέω</span></b> , <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>bind on top,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Aen.Tact.
				37.9
			</span></i> : metaph., <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τὴν ἀπορίαν ἐ.
			μᾶλλον</span> 'tie the knot tighter', <i><span class="en">
				Thphr.
				<u>CP</u>
				2.17.7
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			<i>connect,</i> as words in a sentence, <i><span class="en">
				A.D.
				<u>Adv.</u>
				133.26
			</span></i>:—
				Med.
			, <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐπισυνδέοιτο
				&lt;ἂν&gt; τὰ τῆς κοινωνίας</span> Hierocl.<i><span class="en">
				p.62A.
			</span></i>
		</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			<i>make firm</i> or <i>compact,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τὰ σώματα</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Agathin.
				</span></i>
			 ap. <i><span class="en">
				Orib.
				10.7.14
			</span></i>.</div>
